*
!.gitignore

# Self-hosted WoW class/spec/spell icons, fetched once from Blizzard's Game Data API by
# data/spelldata/fetch-spell-icons.php and fetch-class-spec-icons.php, then committed here so
# new machines (dev or production) don't need BLIZZARD_CLIENT_ID/SECRET just to render icons.
# The corresponding spell_id/slug -> filename mapping is committed separately as
# data/spelldata/icon-manifest.json and applied via `php artisan wow:apply-icon-manifest`
# (no API calls) after any migrate:fresh, since the DB's icon_name columns don't survive that.
# This is the only thing stored under storage/app/public/ in this codebase — see CLAUDE.md.
!spell-icons/
!spell-icons/**
!class-icons/
!class-icons/**
!spec-icons/
!spec-icons/**
